8. Available = 0
Process	Need
P1	     2
P2	     1
P3	     3
Check
Available = 0
P1 needs 2 ✗
P2 needs 1 ✗
P3 needs 3 ✗
No process can execute.

Answer
No process can execute.
Since Available = 0, none of the process needs can be satisfied.
Therefore, the system is in an Unsafe State (and will remain blocked until resources are released).
